00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.200
Go back to class.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:05.700
S-Sure.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:14.620
What's the matter, Retto?

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:16.410
N-Nothing.

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:17.790
Hoshino!

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.790
Stretch with me, not this guy!

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.370
I-Idiot!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:29.830
If you wanna make jokes, make them
about your widow's peak hairline!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.120
That's mean!

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.910
I-I'll tell you one thing.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:37.040
I was only acting like that before
to see what you would do!

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:40.000
I love you either way, Kirara!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:44.160
Yuuna, you know that wasn't the real me!

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:48.160
Really? You were cute
like you used to be, though.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:55.370
You should just be honest
about your feelings already.

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.750
Let's stretch, Kirara!

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.700
O-Okay!

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:13.500
I'm back.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.040
Kirara!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.450
What's up?

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:18.950
It's amazing! So tawdry!

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:21.750
How is it that humans
beat around the bush so much

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.000
when it comes to reproduction?

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:25.870
Don't ask me!

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:31.370
You humans really aren't honest
about your emotions.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.540
Honest, huh?

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:39.790
Watch this soap opera with me, Kirara!

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:43.330
--No excuses! Let's go!
--Hey!

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:50.700
We have succeeded in destroying the
Kiseichuu nest and have taken one prisoner.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:55.830
I believe we'll be able to keep
their invasion at bay for the time being.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:22:00.040
No, we haven't confirmed that yet.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:03.250
Yes. Thank you.

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:07.870
Hoo, boy.

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:10.830
I guess the close-minded Tokyo branch

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:15.540
isn't ready to accept
a Kiseichuu as a comrade.

00:23:47.950 --> 00:23:49.750
Super HXEROS!

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:51.750
Next time: XERO Game!
